{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_title", "source_sha256": "f8d98d9926e2a097adef30afcdc913d9d5fed8200afbe26dbafd8da74436df40", "ja": "貴音とおでかけ2", "zh": "与贵音外出2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5dab75849f1aa15169fcda852b90bbd79089131efe3ae3b0bd6162ca0946122a", "ja": "貴音とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与贵音出门外出的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7680181def99522ccc81c19596f96625ffd7ee0c58b2eabf0e302b4190fa99e0", "ja": "（仕事終わり、せっかくなので名物を食べようと\n貴音と食事に行った。その帰り道……）", "zh": "（工作结束后，难得有机会，就和贵音一起去吃了当地名吃。回去的路上……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1001_008tak", "source_sha256": "dcaa297631d70bd7cdac6c5c78be4add6bff90ad8a47f6fc53b195a340d6ec86", "ja": "大変美味でした。まいるどなとんこつすーぷに、\n香ばしいにんにくの香り……。", "zh": "极其美味。温和醇厚的豚骨汤，\n伴随着焦香诱人的蒜香……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1002_008tak", "source_sha256": "67aa03c322f7d976629224f70e922cb526cf6e8facea92a9e891b2778763fd0a", "ja": "それらが麺とともに渾然一体となり、豊かな味わいが\n広がる……。真、至極の一杯だったかと。", "zh": "它们与面条融为一体，浓郁的滋味随之扩散开来……确实是至极美味的一碗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a139f337deb8a2ebae016e1e70c5c9a085bde66e1b63299c60a187c1b809f4c8", "ja": "よろこんでもらえて良かった。貴音なら、もう\n自分で調べてそうだからとも思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "你能喜欢真是太好了。我还想着贵音的话，\n应该早就自己调查过了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "49ef1a855b01ddcb207b98ab66ffafa31cae323964de76fbf0e76ee93102042c", "ja": "はい。確かに自分でも何軒かせれくとしていましたが、\n先ほどのお店はそのうちの一軒でしたよ。", "zh": "是的。我确实也自己选了几家店，刚才那家就是其中之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "59e560d1306edcd5d875a3433bf006005dcb5f5ff41d9b470a104778dbdde296", "ja": "それは良かった。ところで、まだ少し時間があるけど、\n他に行きたいところはないかな？", "zh": "那就好。对了，虽然还有一点时间，  \n还有没有其他想去的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "223dabbf0599bb63ca21001f2dd1309e34f5ddcf81dd01f43f5d163f03780cb3", "ja": "そうですね……それでは、私がせれくとした\n他の熊本らーめんのお店に……。", "zh": "是啊……那么，就去我挑选的另一家熊本拉面店……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "023b243f98bb95228cf4f2e668b7e5ee9e67859d762001acc6aa73d26b204b0e", "ja": "い、いや、さすがにもう、これ以上は食べられ\nないな……。できれば、他の場所にしてくれないか。", "zh": "不、不行，实在吃不下了……\n要是可以的话，能换成别的地方吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "3c5dee8d961f92cee8fc06df9118f24a5ca3870c20bf599fd8f48b261eb3561c", "ja": "そうですか……。それでは、\n夜景の名所の公園などいかがでしょうか？", "zh": "这样啊……那么，去夜景胜地的公园之类的地方，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1009_008tak", "source_sha256": "c8ab930d2a48bd72ccc0ccc02dfcdddb70c7324526cce43cff4e44b5f589458a", "ja": "よろしければ、共に今宵の月を眺められればと……。", "zh": "若是方便，不知能否同您共赏今宵的明月……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0202_story_008tak02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0202_story_008tak02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bb9e9fb06417a0e07d18a18145189ecdc2fd5fbd4460a8ac6c657ac7c45af1be", "ja": "ああ、もちろん構わないよ。\n今日は天気もいいし、きれいな月が見れそうだな。", "zh": "啊，当然没问题。\n今天天气也很好，看来能看到一轮漂亮的月亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
